<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>title</key>
	<string>我的语音</string>
	<key>items</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>总开关</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>微信文字转语音：捕获你输入的文字，用系统语音或你克隆的音色合成语音消息发出。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>启用</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>enabled</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>发送方式</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>自动＝点「发送」后直接调微信内部录音接口把语音发出去，全程不弹「按住说话」界面、不用你按住（推荐）。关掉＝回到老方式：先合成，再由你自己在聊天页按住「按住 说话」、松开才发送。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>自动发送（无需按住说话）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>autoSend</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>合成引擎</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>离线＝系统中文语音（机器人音，免费、不联网）；云端＝联网合成。选「云端」后请在下面「云端服务」里二选一。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>引擎</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>engineMode</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>离线</string>
				<string>云端</string>
			</array>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>云端服务（引擎选「云端」时生效）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>默认已改为「千问 Qwen-TTS」：官方预置音色，不用克隆、开箱即用，同一个 API Key 通用。音色在微信悬浮球面板里选（支持搜索/语速/语气），更多音色可在下方「千问音色」直接填英文 voice 名。CosyVoice＝克隆/设计你自己的音色（需先在悬浮球→音色管理里创建）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSegmentCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>云端服务</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ttsProvider</string>
			<key>validValues</key>
			<array>
				<integer>0</integer>
				<integer>1</integer>
			</array>
			<key>validTitles</key>
			<array>
				<string>CosyVoice 克隆</string>
				<string>千问 Qwen-TTS</string>
			</array>
			<key>default</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>千问音色</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>qwenVoice</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>Cherry</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>如 Cherry / Ethan / Dylan</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>千问模型</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>qwenModel</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string>qwen3-tts-flash</string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>qwen3-tts-flash</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>指令强化（2.8.8 起）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>开关打开时，所有云端合成指令前面会加一句「务必严格按照以下指令执行」。实验反复证实：模型对"强化前缀"普遍更敏感，音色/方言/风格效果都明显更稳。默认开。要纯靠风格/方言本身指令的，可以关掉试试。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSSwitchCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>指令强化前缀</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>reinforceInstruction</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<true/>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>怎么创建音色（两种方式）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>在微信里做（设置里没有麦克风权限）：打开微信任意聊天 → 点悬浮球 “语” → 点“音色管理”。① 文字设计：填一句描述（如“沉稳的中年男性播音员”）→ 生成音色。不需要录音、不需要 OSS，只需上面的 API Key。② 录音复刻：朗读 15~30 秒干声，需要下面的 OSS。创建后在悬浮球面板里选音色即可。</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>阿里云百炼 DashScope（必填）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>任何功能都只用这一项就够：到 bailian.console.aliyun.com 开通，右上角地域选【华北2 北京】，底部“API Key”卡片创建（sk- 开头，创建时只显示一次）。Key 只存在本机。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>API Key</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>apiKey</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>isPassword</key>
			<true/>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>sk-xxxxxxxx</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>workspace（选填）</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>workspace</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>留空即可，除非你用了子业务空间</string>
			<key>PostNotification</key>
			<string>com.yzdmm2024.myvoice/settings</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>测试 API Key 是否可用</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>testAPIKey</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>对象存储 OSS（只做「录音复刻」才需要）</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>用「文字设计」创建音色的话，这里整段可以全部留空、完全不用配（下面的测试按钮也不用点）。只有「录音复刻」才要把参考音频托管到公网 URL 给百炼抓取：OSS 控制台建一个 Bucket（地域选北京、关掉「阻止公共访问」、读写权限设公共读），Endpoint 填 oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com（不带 https://、不带 bucket 名）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Bucket</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ossBucket</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>myvoice-audio</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Endpoint</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ossHost</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>AccessKey</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ossAk</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>Secret</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>ossSk</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>isPassword</key>
			<true/>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSButtonCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>测试 OSS 地址与公共读</string>
			<key>action</key>
			<string>testOSS</string>
		</dict>

		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSGroupCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>高级</string>
			<key>footerText</key>
			<string>一般无需改。若发送语音失败，先用 frida 确认微信内 sendVoiceToWeChat:toUsr: 所在类名（可留空自动探测）。</string>
		</dict>
		<dict>
			<key>cell</key>
			<string>PSEditTextCell</string>
			<key>label</key>
			<string>sendClass</string>
			<key>key</key>
			<string>sendClass</string>
			<key>default</key>
			<string></string>
			<key>placeholder</key>
			<string>留空自动探测</string>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
